; abnf stdio.gltf diff -- binary wire form IS the diff's own JSON text (see 📝️text/component.ebnf
; for the real JSON grammar), UTF-8 encoded. OpBinary delegates straight to serde_json; no
; separate binary framing exists.
document = json-text
json-text = *UTF8-OCTET  ; well-formed per the sibling text-facet JSON grammar
